{"id":"profi","lemma":"Profi","pos":"noun","rank":2762,"glosses":["pro (professional sports player)","pro (expert, one who is very good at something)","pro (one who does something for payment, rather than as an amateur)"],"ipa":"/ˈpʁoːfi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/70/De-Profi.ogg/De-Profi.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Profis","plural":"Profis"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin ein Profi.","en":"I'm a pro.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Überlassen Sie das den Profis.","en":"Leave it to the professionals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/562253","words":[{"g":"to relinquish something…"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"So machen es die Profis.","en":"That's how the pros do it.","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"to make"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Du bist Profi, und ich bin Amateur.","en":"You're a professional, and I'm an amateur.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"amateur"}]},{"text":"Tom spielt Baseball wie ein Profi.","en":"Tom plays baseball like a pro.","words":[null,{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"},{"g":"baseball"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}